<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>01 / 概念地基</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>两条并行的教学与训练路线</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ marginBottom: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #0E2340', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>两条路线并行支持，共用知识点、步骤与套路的定义及前置关系</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 560, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>路线一 · 以题目为入口</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>按传统线下授课方式，从题目角度组织教学。教授一个母题前，先确保学生掌握该母题包含的全部步骤及其所需知识点，再围绕母题整体教学与训练。通常不会把单独步骤作为独立课程或专项训练对象。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 560, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>路线二 · 单步骤专项训练</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>允许直接针对某一个步骤补充训练。学生某一步薄弱时，可在具备该步骤前置知识点的基础上单独学习、练习该步骤，再应用回完整题目与套路中。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：项目名词与教学关系定义.md §6</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 9 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>